title: catalogue: grice/internal-error
---
error[grice/internal-error]: grice couldn't show its results

The run finished, but grice couldn't render its diagnostics: the span from
byte 0 to byte 9 in `src/app.gleam` isn't inside the source. This is a bug
in grice, not a problem in your code.

Hint: Please report it at https://github.com/alvivi/grice/issues, with the
rules you ran.


